<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.KOREA SHIPPING - STEEL SCRAP CARGOES - AUG 7.</title>
<headline>S.KOREA SHIPPING - STEEL SCRAP CARGOES - AUG 7.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
